61
00:03:47.238 --> 00:03:49.289
So, we waited, here we are.

62
00:03:49.289 --> 00:03:50.491 line:15%
You're in Los Angeles.

63
00:03:50.491 --> 00:03:51.657 line:15%
Good to see you my friend.

64
